cts related to the Green Constelati\on, or or sigils belonging to the entity without name, and even use chants to channel their devotion to it.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 488.825 517.093 534.835]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj131 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radioactive Body - Although they have an anomaly as their main energy source, their bodies are no different from a normal human being's, therefore all they can to to defend from attacks is resist. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919192144-03'00')/NM(0b13cda8c8ee498badf7f34d2c2a2f89)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radioactive Body - Although they have an anomaly as their main energy source, their bodies are no different from a normal human being's, therefore all\ they can to to defend from attacks is resist. </span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 372.553 517.093 442.563]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj132 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Anomalous Radioactivity - This emitted radioactivity from the cultist's bodies apparently do not affect them negatively, but it is confirmed to be noxious to any strangers. The Cult Members can use them in rustic ways to attack targets, be it through a ra\dioactive pulse which damages and slightly pushes the target, and orbs made of concentrated points of that energy, from which they are able to manipulate and launch into the targets in an unknown manner, presumably telekinesis.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240922153141-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Anomalous Radioactivity - This emitted radioactivity from the cultist's bodies apparently do not affect them negatively, but it is confirmed to be noxi\ous to any strangers. The Cult Members can use them in rustic ways to attack targets, be it through a radioactive pulse which damages and slightly pushes the target, and orbs made of concentrated points of that energy, from which they are able to manipula\te and launch into the targets in an unknown manner, presumably telekinesis.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 7.92001 522.984 87.8932]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj133 0 obj<</BS 142 0 R/Contents(Brutal Strikes - The types of Moves that someone common could try to destabilize a person, like punches and kicks, a flying kick, a low swipe and trying to use any available weapons on the Inventory. )/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919191441-03'00')/NM(f830e9b47d1b4fc4ba9f423fdb15389f)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Brutal Strikes - The types of Moves that someone common could try to destabilize a person, like punches and kicks, a flying kick, a low swipe and trying to use any available weapons on the Inventor\y. </p></body>)/Rect[178.587 644.499 517.425 714.509]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj134 0 obj<</BS 141 0 R/Contents(Green Constellation's Enlightenment - The occult knowledge bestowed by the deity illuminates the blessed minds in a more highlighted way about their existence, making them aware about truths in the Natural, Religious, Ontological contexts, and even allowi\ng for studies on an alleged Scientific context.)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919192342-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Green Constellation's Enlightenment - The occult knowledge bestowed by the deity illuminates the blessed minds in a more highlighted way about their existence, making them aware about truths in the\ Natural, Religious, Ontological contexts, and even allowing for studies on an alleged Scientific context.</p></body>)/Rect[179.087 302.907 518.58 360.917]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj135 0 obj<</BS 140 0 R/Contents(Cult Mentality - As every member of a fanatic cult, this excessive amount of faith that they project causes varied types of haziness in their psyches, which in turn cause disturbing negative effects in their lifes. Some of these effects are seen in their \tunnel vision regarding the world, with their interactions being resumed to fanatic discourse, absolute blind loyalty to the deity, general obedience to any compatible superiors and an extreme level of worshipping. )/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:2024091919322